+    "description": (
+        "One canonical 2-by-3 quadratic coefficient matrix per factor: rows "
+        "encode q_x*t^2+l_x*t+c_x and q_y*t^2+l_y*t+c_y over F_p; q is a "
+        "normalized projective direction, l is its prescribed canonical "
