The third bare attempt is still running. If it also fails, the shipping rung will be `easy`; that would lower the measured reference cost and answer-size figures, so I’ll rerun every gate at that exact preset before finalizing.
diff --git a/gen_1306_6796.py b/gen_1306_6796.py
