codex
Rejected honestly; no shipping generator was produced.

The native Track B family used Definition 2.9, Theorem 3.2, and Lemma 3.1 from the [full paper](https://arxiv.org/html/1306.6796v2). G1–G8 passed, but:

- Easy bare: 0/3 solved.
- Easy with structural hint: 1/3 solved.
- Permitted medium retry, bare: 2/3 solved.
- Medium with hint: 1/3 solved.

Further escalation would violate the one-rung G9 allowance. All four successful oracle answers were re-parsed and independently verified.

Files:

- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1306.6796/REJECTED.md)
- [rejected_gen_1306_6796.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1306.6796/rejected_gen_1306_6796.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1306.6796/selftest_report.json)
- [bare transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1306.6796/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [easy hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1306.6796/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [medium bare transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1306.6796/g9_medium_bare_transcript.jsonl)
- [medium hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1306.6796/g9_medium_hinted_transcript.jsonl)

The retained family’s reference algorithm required 6,153,554 difference operations, versus 260 operations for the compact conic-kernel route. The placebo arm was not run after the gated failure and is recorded as unavailable, not fabricated.
